{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"733827237459263519","content":"\"The Hunger has always been ravenous. The more it eats, the more it desires. Long have the Uru misunderstood their role on the island. What once was an act of releasing divinity has become simply an act of eating the dead. Their shaman have forgotten the old way. And the speaking of it's name has gone unchecked. It has been drawing divinity from the island for hundreds of years and is now far greater than ever before.\"","created_at":"2020-08-15T23:21:26.323000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-15T23:21:39.310000Z","id":"744334971677835345","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
